  "implemented": [
    "Actual optional singleton Mobile HTTP/WebSocket owner shares protected SQLite, AgentManager, SyncManager, Git managers and task schedulers; current caller/device/configuration grants and PIN/QR write authority.",
    "Opt-in loopback/LAN access; hashed sessions, one-use pairing, expiry/revocation of live WebSockets, durable transcript reconnect, admission and current HITL routing; bounded SQL preparse/resources/events and explicit refusal of complex unreviewed mobile writes.",
    "Portable actual tunnel child owner retains raw process/stream/configuration closure through timeout/cancellation. Native quick tunnel is unavailable without a host-selected binary; no implicit system binary/download.",
    "Production staging builds and hashes the actual mobile SPA and verifies every physical resource; old artifacts without the reviewed entry do not expose mobile controls.",
    "Copied-profile JSON credential converter requires exact leaf provenance for all currently protected agent/MCP/source fields, preserves noncredential JSON representation, binds authenticated journal recovery to provenance and checks exact planned envelopes.",
    "Actual SQLite/DatabaseManager candidate reopen, wrong-key/tamper/refusal, interruption/SIGKILL recovery and noncredential/reference preservation under Electron and bundled standalone Node.",
    "Finite native/facade codecs, hydration/epoch/event checks and no replay of accepted configuration mutations."
  ],
